\pard\qc\b The Base16, Base32, and Base64 Data Encodings\par
\par

\pard\sl360\slmult1\b0 Status of This Memo\par

\pard\li284\sl240\slmult1 This document specifies an Internaet standards track protocol for the Internet community, and requests discussion and suggestions for improvements. Please refer to the current edition of the "Internet Official Protocol Standards" (STD 1) for the standartization state and status of this protocol. Distribution of this memo is unlimited.\par
